    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Sappy_Question:
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d7918fcd4bc6f7741a6b8c47ac85eff1, type: 2}
    PlayerDialogue: "\u201CIt\u2019s been fun... but am I going to get everything
